                                "sense_id": "35d6b6ff-bed7-35b6-8736-534be7ef0deb",
                                "text": "Temperatures in Bangkok fell as low as 59.3 degrees Fahrenheit (15.2 degrees Celsius) on Monday, the lowest the capital has seen in years, as the country’s weather agency warned cool conditions could persist through mid-February."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
